  'OSN HRMMU – Protection of Civilians in Armed Conflict, září 2026 (PDF)': 'UN HRMMU – Protection of Civilians in Armed Conflict, September 2026 (PDF)',
  'Infografika „Civilian casualties since 24 February 2022“: 17,605 killed, 55,846 injured. · „At least 328 civilians were killed and 2,105 injured in September 2026“ · „Civilian casualties from January to September 2026 (2,570 killed; 15,211 injured)“ · pozn. 1: „January-September 2024: 1,607 killed and 6,764 injured; January-September 2025: 1,943 killed and 9,233 injured.“ · Děti: graf „By age and sex“ (chlapci 462/1 738, dívky 361/1 350, pohlaví neuvedeno 27/285 zabitých/zraněných).': 'Infographic “Civilian casualties since 24 February 2022”: 17,605 killed, 55,846 injured. · “At least 328 civilians were killed and 2,105 injured in September 2026” · “Civilian casualties from January to September 2026 (2,570 killed; 15,211 injured)” · note 1: “January-September 2024: 1,607 killed and 6,764 injured; January-September 2025: 1,943 killed and 9,233 injured.” · Children: chart “By age and sex” (boys 462/1,738, girls 361/1,350, sex unknown 27/285 killed/injured).',
